ter Pakistan curtailed drug exports to Afghanistan, turning Iran’s subsidized market into an attractive source for traffickers. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"e53c1e21521f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"16b457dbd72a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"They argue that wide price gaps between Iran and neighboring countries have made smuggling structurally profitable, sidelining legal export channels.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"88acc9022086\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5529b937a350\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Drug production has increased by around 50% but shortages persist, Mohsen Abdollahzadeh, a board member of the Drug Distributors Syndicate said on Tuesday.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6b169a0a89ad\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"e2e38defb71e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"“Drug smuggling from Iran to Iraq and Afghanistan is so extensive that traders in those countries are unable to import medicines legally and cannot compete with smuggled Iranian drugs,” he added.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5449f140d97d\",\"_type\":\"inlinecontent\",\"stories\":[{\"headline\":\"Iran health officials flag price rises as shortages loom over currency crunch\",\"id\":\"9f535b46-5cde-4fee-a1b9-ff03b2915ba9\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-33b7fb45d06163959ac1fc6b6ce2055fb5ef4e36-1280x853-webp\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"File photo shows a worker inside an Iranian pharmaceutical manufacturing facility.\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-16T07:26:05.798Z\",\"slug\":\"202512169061\",\"type\":\"story\",\"updatedAt\":null},{\"headline\":\"Iran drug stocks under two months, 800 medicines at risk as FX delays bite\",\"id\":\"d7eefc96-2094-49c4-a4be-ed1794e8489a\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"alt\":\"iran medicine shortages (file photo)\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-4d4c7834402cf5b57e4656c273bced2421d5cea5-1169x874-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-14T08:35:28.388Z\",\"slug\":\"202512142407\",\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":null},{\"headline\":\"Iran medical suppliers warn of worsening drug shortages\",\"id\":\"35e77d92-103a-4349-bee5-34038c24f951\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-e324556fc8acb58f6113672ef6434ea16f3df585-1280x853-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"crop\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageCrop\",\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"right\":0,\"top\":0},\"hotspot\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageHotspot\",\"height\":1,\"width\":1,\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5}},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-13T09:53:41.002Z\",\"slug\":\"202512136473\",\"type\":\"story\",\"updatedAt\":null}]},{\"_key\":\"b527aa6dc8c5\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0b84c32e73a2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Food and Drug Administration of Iran has conceded that so-called “reverse smuggling” exists, driven by sharp price differences with neighboring markets. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f46908e6c854\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0b84c32e73a2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"However, spokesperson Mohammad Hashemi disputed a widespread surge, saying documented cases remain limited. Continued leakage, he warned, could trigger intermittent shortages and place further strain on an already fragile supply chain.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c5739ceb252e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fb48a5b94de4\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Recent talks with an Afghan delegation, Hashemi said, focused on expanding formal pharmaceutical exports and improving monitoring, a move critics say reflects belated damage control rather than a solution to entrenched enforcement gaps.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"09bfa176380e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"4836ea260d28\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Food market shows same fault lines\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"6b9071fa95aa\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0569f00592d0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The controversy mirrors developments in food markets, where currency policy shifts and the removal of subsidized exchange rates have driven sharp increases in staple prices. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5bf240516c7b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0569f00592d0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Analysts say both sectors show the same pattern: multiple pricing regimes and weak oversight have encouraged arbitrage and cross-border leakage.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ad7eac368d5b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"fad028f25be1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"For consumers, the result has been recurrent shortages and rising costs, as subsidized goods – whether medicine or food – slip out of regulated channels faster than authorities can contain them.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"4bb2952657cb\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ff290443abb1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Authorities say medicines are still available for now, but concede that delays in transferring allocated foreign exchange, mounting arrears to suppliers and dwindling inventories have pushed the sector to the brink, increasing the risk of shortages in the final months of the Iranian year, which ends on March 20.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9901d715c71f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"2859d93efa25\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"In an economy battered by chronic inflation and currency volatility, officials say, keeping drug prices frozen shifts the burden onto manufacturers and ultimately jeopardizes national drug supply chain.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ebbd147f-3931-4e38-a714-009e28e5a831\",\"slug\":\"economy-and-environment\",\"title\":\"Economy \u0026 Environment\"},{\"id\":\"48739cc6-b289-4f2a-9638-6b286ddc70db\",\"slug\":\"iran-en\",\"title\":\"Iran\"},{\"id\":\"5f533911-5248-4846-a1bb-ee70d0e845e5\",\"slug\":\"afghanistan-en\",\"title\":\"Afghanistan\"}],\"hasTextToSpeech\":true,\"headline\":\"Iranian drugmakers warn illicit exports to Afghanistan are rising\",\"id\":\"c5b51b47-e906-457c-a6c4-ea22cbbc3158\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/f01e3c01d8cc10685603319283a1ac0c483b8451-1200x804.jpg?rect=0,2,1200,800\u0026w=576\u0026h=384\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/f01e3c01d8cc10685603319283a1ac0c483b8451-1200x804.jpg?rect=0,2,1200,800\u0026w=768\u0026h=512\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/f01e3c01d8cc10685603319283a1ac0c483b8451-1200x804.jpg?rect=0,2,1200,800\u0026w=992\u0026h=661\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iranian pharmaceutical industry figures warned that illicit Iranian-made medicines are increasingly appearing in Afghanistan, undercutting legal exports and deepening shortages at home.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-23T12:37:38.176Z\",\"revision\":null,\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202512235523\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-05T22:30:37Z\"},{\"authors\":null,\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"dc5c2cfc2dc0\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c6555a2bf464\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The session was held to share information between the government and lawmakers on how to address public grievances, Abbas Goudarzi, spokesperson for parliament’s presiding board, told reporters after the meeting.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b57c7ebf5177\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"68892bc899e6\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"He said a five-member joint committee had been formed between the government and parliament, with briefings delivered by the heads of the Planning and Budget Organization and the Central Bank of Iran.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"68c27d5cab12\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"389a1e06da9c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Ineffective policies\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"0d5b8c2c1b93\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"86322e8842f0\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Goudarzi cited oil sales, the return of export earnings and unresolved foreign-currency obligations as key factors shaping current economic conditions, saying their combined impact had produced the present situation.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"503db26e9878\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"6e9094025ee9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"He pointed to the allocation of about $10 billion in subsidized foreign currency for essential goods as an example of ineffective policy design, adding that roughly $8 billion was directed to livestock feed while consumers continued to pay market prices for basic items.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"8cd97bbeda5b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"52d7bfdce934\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"“There is no logic in allocating this volume of currency if it does not reach its target,” Goudarzi said, adding that existing mechanisms had failed to translate support into lower costs for households.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5d40f4e33f0e\",\"_type\":\"inlinecontent\",\"stories\":[{\"headline\":\"Iranian government pins inflation on unbacked money printing\",\"id\":\"eff5f751-a8e4-4041-b7cd-b77a620fa663\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"alt\":\"A worker stacks bundles of old Iranian banknotes (undated)\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-09d0a3c47aa9b13286bd54da24f94bf6e8051b9b-1300x867-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"A worker stacks bundles of old Iranian banknotes \",\"crop\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageCrop\",\"bottom\":0.12281104777813692,\"left\":0.06142862153696218,\"right\":0,\"top\":0},\"hotspot\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageHotspot\",\"height\":0.8771889522218631,\"width\":0.9385713784630378,\"x\":0.5307143107684811,\"y\":0.43859447611093155}},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-04T10:50:01.428Z\",\"slug\":\"202512041335\",\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":null},{\"headline\":\"Inside Iran’s maze of multiple exchange rates \",\"id\":\"440f9d34-9025-42da-9ee2-b45536768fb3\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-60ceb896ef59ad33ae285e86213bf9861028dbf7-720x480-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"A currency dealer poses for a photo with a U.S one dollar bill and Iranian rials in an exchange shop in Tehran, Iran December 25, 2022.\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-04-30T12:33:00.000Z\",\"slug\":\"202504309977\",\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":null}]},{\"_key\":\"686ef6a8dea2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d4b822b95d1e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Iran introduced its preferential foreign-exchange system in April 2018 under then president Hassan Rouhani, fixing the dollar at 42,000 rials in an effort to cushion households from price shocks and ensure imports of essential goods and medicines using oil revenues.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9d80180f1d17\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ec2b5d5f2b74\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"As the gap between the official and market rates widened – and the rial slid to record lows above 1.32 million per dollar this week – the policy became increasingly costly.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d70a07a4184a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ec2b5d5f2b74\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The administration of Ebrahim Raisi dismantled the system as part of what it branded “economic surgery,” arguing that it fueled arbitrage, corruption among importers, and failed to benefit consumers.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5c56cfba3bff\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d3ad06938fd7\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Several months later, the government reinstated subsidized currency at 285,000 rials to the dollar, roughly half the market rate at the time. The scheme initially covered 25 categories of goods, though the list has since been pared back.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"10f56e6f72be\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"18a450b1fdc1\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"In recent months, preferential currency has been removed from imports of staples including rice, vegetable oil, red meat, animal feed, and some medicines.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"355c3084890b\",\"_type\":\"inlinecontent\",\"stories\":[{\"headline\":\"Iran health officials flag price rises as shortages loom over currency crunch\",\"id\":\"9f535b46-5cde-4fee-a1b9-ff03b2915ba9\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-33b7fb45d06163959ac1fc6b6ce2055fb5ef4e36-1280x853-webp\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"File photo shows a worker inside an Iranian pharmaceutical manufacturing facility.\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-16T07:26:05.798Z\",\"slug\":\"202512169061\",\"type\":\"story\",\"updatedAt\":null},{\"headline\":\"Prices soar, basics scarce: Iranians struggle to fill the cart\",\"id\":\"4eb68e91-2603-49b5-89eb-850f54e98214\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"alt\":\"A man with shopping cart in a supermarket in Tehran (File photo)\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-2d191d2278415ffd9626b04ce54aee5dc1e4fac5-1100x700-webp\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"crop\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageCrop\",\"bottom\":0.02917585499724249,\"left\":0.0809436352626211,\"right\":0,\"top\":0},\"hotspot\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageHotspot\",\"height\":0.9708241450027575,\"width\":0.9190563647373788,\"x\":0.5404718176313106,\"y\":0.48541207250137874}},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-03T10:14:27.460Z\",\"slug\":\"202512032701\",\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":null}]},{\"_key\":\"f4da17289c60\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a6969e870695\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Budget pressure builds\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5505274fe48f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"974ff96c24fa\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Tuesday morning session, Goudarzi said, was held behind closed doors, with an open afternoon meeting scheduled with the president.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"d67d2c4a1bff\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"674619563de5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The government will submit the draft budget to Iran’s parliament on Tuesday for the first time based on the new rial, following the removal of four zeros from the national currency.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"359c7647eb58\",\"_type\":\"inlinecontent\",\"stories\":[{\"headline\":\"Iran’s Central Bank ordered to slash four zeros from national currency\",\"id\":\"8b4ed602-fd61-4835-8a07-512158a70997\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-108cd84a583155fd5ef9fdcf3005347b6d5e1646-1200x800-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-11-22T22:23:00.000Z\",\"slug\":\"202511224715\",\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":null}]},{\"_key\":\"9b01fb53d44f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"ca7ff49687ba\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The new year's budget bill is being submitted to parliament amid signs it has been drafted as one of the most contractionary budgets in recent years.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"fc69c0e5a455\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b035eb4c0fd5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Goudarzi described the Tuesday meeting as an attempt to coordinate the executive and legislative branches to manage economic and currency challenges.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"1109d0563840\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"5227940b0ce9\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"He outlined a compressed review timetable, saying the draft budget will be examined by the combined budget committee within three days before being sent to the plenary, whether approved or rejected.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a16c12856b9f\",\"_type\":\"figure\",\"alt\":\"An Iranian shopper browses staple goods in a supermarket as inflation continues to erode purchasing power, pushing food prices further out of reach for many households.\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-33538f273f4636d0e4b5903bbdc65ec60d3e280a-1280x1082-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"An Iranian shopper browses staple goods in a supermarket as inflation continues to erode purchasing power, pushing food prices further out of reach for many households.\",\"sources\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/33538f273f4636d0e4b5903bbdc65ec60d3e280a-1280x1082.jpg?rect=0,30,1280,1022\u0026w=576\u0026h=460\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"5x4\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/33538f273f4636d0e4b5903bbdc65ec60d3e280a-1280x1082.jpg?rect=0,30,1280,1023\u0026w=768\u0026h=614\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"5x4\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/33538f273f4636d0e4b5903bbdc65ec60d3e280a-1280x1082.jpg?rect=0,30,1280,1023\u0026w=992\u0026h=793\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"5x4\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}}},{\"_key\":\"15ae1d47e49a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c1c5d2dcc7c8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"If endorsed, it will then move to specialist committees for further study under strict deadlines before returning to the combined committee and, ultimately, the full chamber.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ee1b1b546fcc\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1214d7e8185f\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Goudarzi noted that under parliamentary rules the government was required to submit the budget on December 23, but did so a day later because no open session was held to formally trigger the review process. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"ebbd147f-3931-4e38-a714-009e28e5a831\",\"slug\":\"economy-and-environment\",\"title\":\"Economy \u0026 Environment\"},{\"id\":\"48739cc6-b289-4f2a-9638-6b286ddc70db\",\"slug\":\"iran-en\",\"title\":\"Iran\"},{\"id\":\"6f601e67-f5f1-45da-b946-18dd303b0e28\",\"slug\":\"politics\",\"title\":\"Domestic Politics\"}],\"hasTextToSpeech\":true,\"headline\":\"Iran parliament holds closed-door meeting with government officials on economy\",\"id\":\"ce3708fd-b617-40f1-9b74-62ab5c7eed15\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/250b124d239f735d8b60419a804e304fd29a2a36-1280x853.jpg?w=576\u0026h=384\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/250b124d239f735d8b60419a804e304fd29a2a36-1280x853.jpg?w=768\u0026h=512\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/250b124d239f735d8b60419a804e304fd29a2a36-1280x853.jpg?w=992\u0026h=661\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iran’s parliament convened a closed session with senior government officials on Tuesday to assess economic conditions, as lawmakers said subsidy and currency policies had not translated into tangible relief for many households.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-23T10:28:25.429Z\",\"revision\":null,\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202512235699\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-05T22:30:41Z\"},{\"authors\":null,\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"34453f40ba5a\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a56e379ad2e8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The State Department cited the case of Aqil Keshavarz, a 27-year-old architecture student, saying he was arrested during the 12-day war with Israel in June, denied a fair trial and executed on what it described as fabricated spying charges.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7ebac14cd73b\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a56e379ad2e8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Iran’s judiciary said on Saturday that Keshavarz was executed after the Supreme Court upheld his death sentence. Rights groups have said he was tortured to force a confession, allegations Iranian authorities deny.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"69e210c87035\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a56e379ad2e8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The State Department said more than 1,800 people had been executed in Iran so far this year.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"a44cb6b3-1660-469d-b2b6-3e285d2a6284\",\"slug\":\"iran-human-rights\",\"title\":\"Human Rights\"},{\"id\":\"f52ff450-8204-493d-890a-aa701ac40190\",\"slug\":\"iran-politic\",\"title\":\"Iran Politics\"},{\"id\":\"48739cc6-b289-4f2a-9638-6b286ddc70db\",\"slug\":\"iran-en\",\"title\":\"Iran\"}],\"hasTextToSpeech\":true,\"headline\":\"Iran executed over 17 prisoners in 48 hours, US says\",\"id\":\"5191d7a7-8ba5-4cc6-a5ab-320c8d08ed41\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652.png?rect=1,0,978,652\u0026w=576\u0026h=384\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652.png?rect=1,0,978,652\u0026w=768\u0026h=512\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652.png?rect=1,0,978,652\u0026w=992\u0026h=661\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"“Only in 48 hours, the Islamic Republic regime executed more than 17 prisoners,” the US State Department said in a post on its Persian-language account on Tuesday.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-23T09:38:50.979Z\",\"revision\":null,\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202512238654\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"story\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-12-23T10:10:36Z\"},{\"authors\":null,\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"483cf7600e43\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"345bf71ac188\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The analysis said senior security officials fear that heightened public messaging – often attributed to unnamed senior diplomatic or Western intelligence sources – could be misinterpreted by Iran at a time of fragile ceasefires and unresolved regional flashpoints, raising the risk of an unintended escalation neither side is seeking.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"3f25cd68bf65\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"b48ca3fd1ab5\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The recent spate of reports comes ahead of Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu’s expected meeting with US President Donald Trump in Washington later this month, and coincides with mounting pressure on Israel’s government over stalled ceasefire arrangements in Gaza and the lack of progress toward a state inquiry into the October 7 attacks.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"4fb054ad7e0f\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"41333ed33674\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Israeli officials cited in the Ynet analysis said that Iran currently relies heavily on Israeli media coverage to assess Israel’s intentions, as Iranian intelligence operations inside Israel have become increasingly constrained.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"ed47b5628e89\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3be1cb573c19\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Israeli authorities have disclosed that dozens of suspected Iranian espionage attempts have been foiled since the start of the war.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"be645babeca9\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d5430d61f0e3\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"“If Iran concludes that Israel is once again preparing for war, it may consider striking first,” senior security officials were quoted as saying, warning that public speculation and unofficial briefings could prove more destabilizing than deliberate military signaling.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"0e0c1620ca31\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a23c659f3de2\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Israeli defense officials have repeatedly cautioned this year that a renewed conflict with Iran could stem from miscommunication rather than a strategic decision by either side, particularly following June’s 12-day confrontation. They stressed that recent Iranian military exercises do not necessarily signal preparations for an imminent attack.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"bbfaf7812629\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"00bb3b7abc0b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"According to Israeli assessments cited in the analysis, Iran is currently focused on rebuilding and upgrading its military capabilities, strengthening intelligence collection, and supplying weapons and funding to allied groups including Hezbollah in Lebanon and the Houthis in Yemen.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5bec6fbea531\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"c90509f23169\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"While Israeli officials believe Iran has not yet crossed thresholds that would trigger Israeli military action, they warn that Tehran could misread Israeli preparations as an imminent threat, prompting a preemptive strike that could rapidly widen the conflict.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f598311cd0e2\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7bf8953afd8e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Another major uncertainty is Hezbollah’s role in any future confrontation. During the summer conflict with Iran, the Lebanese group refrained from launching attacks, but Israeli planners are preparing for the possibility that such restraint may not hold in a future crisis.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"85c79243283c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"eff10354f912\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"With Gaza, the northern front and Iran all expected to feature prominently in talks between Netanyahu and Trump, Israeli officials say the government may face difficult trade-offs across multiple arenas as it seeks to preserve US diplomatic and military backing.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"febf4192-20fa-4abb-8071-0a1f0c4f6ea8\",\"slug\":\"mideast-crisis\",\"title\":\"Mideast Crisis\"},{\"id\":\"16419264-35fd-43b2-af3d-751cb9696170\",\"slug\":\"israel\",\"title\":\"Israel\"},{\"id\":\"48739cc6-b289-4f2a-9638-6b286ddc70db\",\"slug\":\"iran-en\",\"title\":\"Iran\"}],\"hasTextToSpeech\":true,\"headline\":\"Israel fears public rhetoric on Iran raise risk of unintended war - Ynet\",\"id\":\"1dabba40-ca43-4c1b-a3fc-b168bd323b9f\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/c79dfbb0b20aeb1bd33375bffb920c1c50791b6e-567x370.jpg?rect=9,0,550,344\u0026w=576\u0026h=360\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x10\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/c79dfbb0b20aeb1bd33375bffb920c1c50791b6e-567x370.jpg?rect=9,0,550,344\u0026w=768\u0026h=480\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x10\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/c79dfbb0b20aeb1bd33375bffb920c1c50791b6e-567x370.jpg?rect=9,0,550,344\u0026w=992\u0026h=620\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x10\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"A surge in Israeli reports and briefings on possible action against Iran could increase the risk of unintended escalation, Israeli security officials cautioned, with a Ynet analysis warning that public discussion may be misread by Tehran at a sensitive moment.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-23T09:06:49.988Z\",\"revision\":null,\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202512238157\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-05T22:30:44Z\"},{\"authors\":null,\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"7e3dc1bb5a90\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a6e39f1eaa07\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Kan’s Arab affairs correspondent Roey Kais said the funds arrive regularly, mainly by air and that Hezbollah members continue to receive high salaries by Lebanese standards, but rebuilding the arsenal destroyed in the conflict remains costly.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b41dff3385c3\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"75bbbafaa388\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"“In recent months, Hezbollah’s top leaders and the Iranian Quds Force sat down to negotiate how much money Tehran would transfer this year to Hezbollah,” Kais said.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"83be7eb5cd90\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"7f287229e265\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"“To this day, there are still complaints within Hezbollah’s ranks that the money arriving from the Iranians is insufficient for the organization’s needs, but despite that, it must be emphasized that everything agreed upon with the Iranians arrives precisely and regularly,” he added in a post on X.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7c30a29296c9\",\"_type\":\"twitter\",\"id\":\"https://x.com/kaisos1987/status/2003187122212053031?s=20\",\"embed\":{\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/kaisos1987/status/2003187122212053031\",\"author_name\":\"roi kais • روعي كايس • רועי קייס\",\"author_url\":\"https://twitter.com/kaisos1987\",\"html\":\"\u003cblockquote class=\\\"twitter-tweet\\\" data-theme=\\\"light\\\"\u003e\u003cp lang=\\\"ar\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\"\u003eخاص لقناة \u003ca href=\\\"https://twitter.com/kann_news?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\\\"\u003e@kann_news\u003c/a\u003e: تواصل طهران تحويل مئات ملايين الدولارات إلى حزب الله خلال العام الأخير من أجل إعادة ترميم التنظيم بعد الحرب، لكن تبيّن أن قيادة حزب الله ترى أن ذلك غير كافٍ.خلال الأشهر الأخيرة عقد كبار قادة حزب الله وقيادة فيلق القدس التابع للحرس الثوري الإيراني اجتماعات… \u003ca href=\\\"https://t.co/o8iWFgwrJ1\\\"\u003ehttps://t.co/o8iWFgwrJ1\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u0026mdash; roi kais • روعي كايس • רועי קייס (@kaisos1987) \u003ca href=\\\"https://twitter.com/kaisos1987/status/2003187122212053031?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\\\"\u003eDecember 22, 2025\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\\n\\n\",\"width\":550,\"height\":null,\"type\":\"rich\",\"cache_age\":\"3153600000\",\"provider_name\":\"Twitter\",\"provider_url\":\"https://twitter.com\",\"version\":\"1.0\"}},{\"_key\":\"13e2ccde5cd7\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"d42fa908bb9b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The report comes amid scrutiny of Iran’s financial support for Hezbollah, which a \"},{\"_key\":\"32c7121c0225\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"d9369bac5878\"],\"text\":\"US official said\"},{\"_key\":\"68b40c18836b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" has totaled around $1 billion so far this year despite heavy sanctions on Tehran.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"d9369bac5878\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.iranintl.com/en/202511116410\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"f5668921d354\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"8ec0c07a907e\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"US officials targeted what they describe as Hezbollah’s “cash network,” last month, \"},{\"_key\":\"fc861630a943\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"2be01d036830\"],\"text\":\"sanctioning alleged\"},{\"_key\":\"3d84f164f754\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" financiers who move Iranian funds through exchange houses and front companies to help the group rebuild its military infrastructure and pay fighters.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"2be01d036830\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.iranintl.com/en/202511061486\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"c166f6ec5c88\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3827c4fdcb08\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"United Against Nuclear Iran (UANI) policy director Jason Brodsky seized on the Kan report as further evidence that sanctions are biting, saying pressure remains a useful tool. \"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"b6b06d094832\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"3827c4fdcb08\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"“The next time you hear arguments that sanctions and pressure don’t work, remember this thread. If there were no sanctions, Iran would be providing Hezbollah with more,” Brodsky posted on X.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"cfbb2117426f\",\"_type\":\"twitter\",\"id\":\"https://x.com/JasonMBrodsky/status/2003198132947923288?s=20\",\"embed\":{\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/JasonMBrodsky/status/2003198132947923288\",\"author_name\":\"Jason Brodsky\",\"author_url\":\"https://twitter.com/JasonMBrodsky\",\"html\":\"\u003cblockquote class=\\\"twitter-tweet\\\" data-theme=\\\"light\\\"\u003e\u003cp lang=\\\"en\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"\u003eAccording to \u003ca href=\\\"https://twitter.com/kann_news?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\\\"\u003e@kann_news\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href=\\\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/Hezbollah?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\\\"\u003e#Hezbollah\u003c/a\u003e wanted $2 billion for the year, but \u003ca href=\\\"https://twitter.com/hashtag/Iran?src=hash\u0026amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\\\"\u003e#Iran\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s regime, deep in an economic hole, was only willing to provide them $1 billion. The next time you hear arguments that sanctions and pressure don\u0026#39;t work, remember this thread. If there were no… \u003ca href=\\\"https://t.co/7a75ZtBMrU\\\"\u003ehttps://t.co/7a75ZtBMrU\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u0026mdash; Jason Brodsky (@JasonMBrodsky) \u003ca href=\\\"https://twitter.com/JasonMBrodsky/status/2003198132947923288?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\\\"\u003eDecember 22, 2025\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\\n\\n\",\"width\":550,\"height\":null,\"type\":\"rich\",\"cache_age\":\"3153600000\",\"provider_name\":\"Twitter\",\"provider_url\":\"https://twitter.com\",\"version\":\"1.0\"}},{\"_key\":\"dea3110a4896\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"41f76c8052b8\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Hezbollah has been \"},{\"_key\":\"8fd79cec4d69\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"8ab569ad7fcd\"],\"text\":\"trying to restore\"},{\"_key\":\"69507bc0dc64\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" its capabilities after a bruising confrontation with Israel, which killed thousands of people and severely damaged the group’s command structure and arsenal.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"8ab569ad7fcd\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.iranintl.com/en/202511206795\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"984504a799fe\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1d6c683a2279\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"Lebanese leaders, under international pressure, have meanwhile floated plans to disarm militias and extend state authority in the south, but Hezbollah has \"},{\"_key\":\"8c10f0faf39a\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"8491a950de54\"],\"text\":\"resisted efforts\"},{\"_key\":\"efb717c7e243\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\" to curb its arsenal, arguing that its weapons remain essential to deter Israel.\"}],\"markDefs\":[{\"_key\":\"8491a950de54\",\"_type\":\"link\",\"href\":\"https://www.iranintl.com/en/202512114924\"}],\"style\":\"normal\"}],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"febf4192-20fa-4abb-8071-0a1f0c4f6ea8\",\"slug\":\"mideast-crisis\",\"title\":\"Mideast Crisis\"},{\"id\":\"48739cc6-b289-4f2a-9638-6b286ddc70db\",\"slug\":\"iran-en\",\"title\":\"Iran\"}],\"hasTextToSpeech\":true,\"headline\":\"Hezbollah sought $2 billion a year from Iran, settled for half – Kan News\",\"id\":\"42085520-6341-4154-a7ce-215d8875461a\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/9c1af3eb45830a97429e9c6edc06c3b76c59676a-1920x1280.jpg?w=576\u0026h=384\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/9c1af3eb45830a97429e9c6edc06c3b76c59676a-1920x1280.jpg?w=768\u0026h=512\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/9c1af3eb45830a97429e9c6edc06c3b76c59676a-1920x1280.jpg?rect=0,1,1920,1279\u0026w=992\u0026h=661\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Israeli public broadcaster Kan News reported on Monday that Hezbollah requested approximately $2 billion in annual funding from Iran to rebuild after the war, but Tehran agreed to transfer only about $1 billion.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2025-12-23T00:16:20.965Z\",\"revision\":null,\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202512229294\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-05T22:30:47Z\"}],\"allowSlugTitleChange\":true,\"translations\":{\"sectionTitle\":\"More Stories\",\"loadMore\":\"Load More\",\"loading\":\"Loading...\",\"currentArticle\":\"Current Article\",\"share\":\"common.share\"}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"2f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"ArticleSidebar-module-scss-module__9-RIiG__sidebar\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"ArticleSidebar-module-scss-module__9-RIiG__item\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$8\",null,{\"fallback\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeleton\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeletonHeader\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonTextContainer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__large \",\"style\":{\"width\":\"150px\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeletonList\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeletonListItem\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonTextContainer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeletonListItem\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonTextContainer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeletonListItem\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonTextContainer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeletonListItem\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonTextContainer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":\"$undefined\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonText Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__small \",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]]}]}]]}]]}],\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L38\",null,{\"widget\":{\"data\":{\"items\":[{\"headline\":\"36,500 deaths in context: How Iran’s toll compares with wars and crackdowns\",\"id\":\"dd50406d-9994-41c4-b6c4-51b5c790be75\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-bec617ad75902d42d26ba540f9421ba7ecad6054-1280x751-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"The bodies of slain protesters at an unnamed morgue in Iran (January 2026) \"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"The killing of 36,500 people in just two days represents a scale of violence without precedent in the history of repression under the Islamic Republic – and one that stands out even when compared with some of the deadliest episodes of state violence and full-scale wars worldwide.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T12:02:30.113Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601277218\",\"tags\":[{\"color\":\"#0084bc\",\"id\":\"73b1863d-5f72-4a43-a578-40a59fc0e60b\",\"slug\":\"insight\",\"title\":\"INSIGHT\"}],\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"US renews nuclear and missile demands on Iran as ‘armada’ arrives\",\"id\":\"3b55c55b-fdc0-4e89-a123-83d83c18b2d5\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-d5bb82018546ac3aa6954370b47d0dcaab32a895-4582x3448-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"The Trump administration wants Tehran to halt its nuclear “escalations,” ballistic missile program and support for regional proxy groups, a spokesperson for the Department of State told Iran International on Monday.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T00:47:47.871Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601275146\",\"tags\":[{\"color\":\"#cf2023\",\"id\":\"92efbced-9c0f-428b-9506-12d645faf6aa\",\"slug\":\"exclusive\",\"title\":\"EXCLUSIVE\"}],\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iran’s repeated use of 3,117 fuels doubts about official statistics\",\"id\":\"d61fa1ee-1f90-4936-94a6-a8cd061732ef\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-c4637f302413dfa287b2b2a8906305401402ec26-970x549-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"Relatives search for missing loved ones among the bodies of slain protesters at the Kahrizak morgue complex. (January 2026)\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"A single number – 3,117 – has appeared repeatedly in Iranian official statistics, from protest deaths to public health data, raising doubts about the credibility and methodology behind state-reported statistics.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T08:50:59.213Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601263163\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"'Where are you, son?' Iranian father's morgue odyssey breaks hearts\",\"id\":\"a035eaf9-12d1-4b21-9f16-d4f1503d3031\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-1daf300789d7deaa9489f7a3cdd04e2cf97b600c-665x1215-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"Iranian youth Sepehr Shokri, 25, killed on January 8 in Tehran\",\"crop\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageCrop\",\"bottom\":0.35994707386546865,\"left\":0,\"right\":0,\"top\":0},\"hotspot\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageHotspot\",\"height\":0.6400529261345314,\"width\":1,\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.3200264630672657}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"A long video of an Iranian father's agonized trudge among the bloodied corpses of slain protestors in a Tehran morgue in search of his son has seared viewers with the enormity of the state's mass killings this month.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T16:54:00.000Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601260391\",\"tags\":[{\"color\":\"#0084bc\",\"id\":\"73b1863d-5f72-4a43-a578-40a59fc0e60b\",\"slug\":\"insight\",\"title\":\"INSIGHT\"}],\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Wealthy Iranian brothers chose protest and were killed\",\"id\":\"85cc4e21-90e7-4970-99a4-5a4d9eef4962\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-1dca55ba7d81281474fc9ec8c4494ddabc25853e-1050x1199-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"Hamid and Vahid Arzanlou \",\"crop\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageCrop\",\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"right\":0.07836326800675283,\"top\":0},\"hotspot\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageHotspot\",\"height\":1,\"width\":0.9216367319932471,\"x\":0.46081836599662357,\"y\":0.5}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Brothers Hamid and Vahid Arzanlou were two well-known entrepreneurs in Iran’s furniture industry who despite their wealth still chose to raise their voices in anti-government protests this month and paid with their lives.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-28T01:53:57.378Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601274875\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iranians burying slain protest youths mourn with dancing and defiance\",\"id\":\"a5b4ac0d-cb41-41f0-94aa-adcbd15867b2\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-7d6dd95581ef6fc83cf490ee221f1709a0c53f98-1396x783-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iranian families are turning funerals of youths killed in a deadly protest crackdown this month into celebrations of life, with dancing and wedding music aimed at defying their heartbreak and state repression.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T20:10:00.000Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601269005\",\"tags\":[{\"color\":\"#0084bc\",\"id\":\"73b1863d-5f72-4a43-a578-40a59fc0e60b\",\"slug\":\"insight\",\"title\":\"INSIGHT\"}],\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iranian, Venezuelan dissidents call for US action to reclaim lost homelands\",\"id\":\"f9e0be12-4481-412b-919d-7198ae77a4e1\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"alt\":\"Special conversation between Masih Alinejad and María Machado, leader of the Venezuelan opposition and Nobel Peace Prize winner\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-ca5bf07c4a7412409a8a405605e317e5f0a3b4d2-1920x1080-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"Special conversation between Masih Alinejad and María Machado, leader of the Venezuelan opposition and Nobel Peace Prize winner\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iranian and Venezuelan opposition figures in a meeting in Washington DC urged the United States and its allies to act against what they described as an axis of repression between their two countries.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T22:30:00.000Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601274200\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"A protester’s final wish: 'Bury me wrapped in the lion and sun flag'\",\"id\":\"fc047179-c049-4aaa-bea7-2ca8be0360db\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-86f26fc913da726df05ef5cb821f0fcfb0047eca-716x444-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"caption\":\"Mojtaba (Shahmorad) Shahpari\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Mojtaba (Shahmorad) Shahpari, a protester from the southwestern Iranian city of Izeh who was injured during the nationwide protests and later found dead in a cold storage warehouse in Isfahan, was laid to rest wrapped in the lion and sun flag, fulfilling his final wish.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T21:17:08.810Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601266691\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iran judiciary says man convicted of spying for Israel’s Mossad was executed\",\"id\":\"37c326be-c6ee-4410-9427-20098c0d1434\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"},\"crop\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageCrop\",\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"right\":0,\"top\":0},\"hotspot\":{\"_type\":\"sanity.imageHotspot\",\"height\":1,\"width\":1,\"x\":0.5,\"y\":0.5}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iran’s judiciary said on Wednesday it executed a man it identified as Hamidreza Sabet Esmailipour, whom it accused of spying for Israel’s intelligence service, Mossad, after his death sentence was upheld by the Supreme Court.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-28T07:22:35.558Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601286083\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"story\"},{\"headline\":\"US deports three former IRGC members, ICE says\",\"id\":\"7f37fd34-7bcf-4dc3-b2cf-cce3a243e60a\",\"image\":{\"_type\":\"figure\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-f6c553690bfa74af3dc88eecbc71f1071ad97707-686x384-jpg\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"The United States has deported three former members of Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC), US Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) said in a post on X.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-28T07:53:06.827Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601287563\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"story\"}]},\"type\":\"mostview\",\"items\":[{\"headline\":\"36,500 deaths in context: How Iran’s toll compares with wars and crackdowns\",\"id\":\"dd50406d-9994-41c4-b6c4-51b5c790be75\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/bec617ad75902d42d26ba540f9421ba7ecad6054-1280x751.jpg?rect=0,16,1280,720\u0026w=576\u0026h=324\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/bec617ad75902d42d26ba540f9421ba7ecad6054-1280x751.jpg?rect=0,16,1280,720\u0026w=768\u0026h=432\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/bec617ad75902d42d26ba540f9421ba7ecad6054-1280x751.jpg?rect=0,16,1280,720\u0026w=992\u0026h=558\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"36,500 deaths in context: How Iran’s toll compares with wars and crackdowns\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"The killing of 36,500 people in just two days represents a scale of violence without precedent in the history of repression under the Islamic Republic – and one that stands out even when compared with some of the deadliest episodes of state violence and full-scale wars worldwide.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T12:02:30.113Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601277218\",\"tags\":\"$2f:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:props:widget:data:items:0:tags\",\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"US renews nuclear and missile demands on Iran as ‘armada’ arrives\",\"id\":\"3b55c55b-fdc0-4e89-a123-83d83c18b2d5\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/d5bb82018546ac3aa6954370b47d0dcaab32a895-4582x3448.jpg?rect=0,6,4582,3437\u0026w=576\u0026h=432\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x3\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/d5bb82018546ac3aa6954370b47d0dcaab32a895-4582x3448.jpg?rect=0,6,4582,3437\u0026w=768\u0026h=576\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x3\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/d5bb82018546ac3aa6954370b47d0dcaab32a895-4582x3448.jpg?rect=0,6,4582,3437\u0026w=992\u0026h=744\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x3\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"US renews nuclear and missile demands on Iran as ‘armada’ arrives\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"The Trump administration wants Tehran to halt its nuclear “escalations,” ballistic missile program and support for regional proxy groups, a spokesperson for the Department of State told Iran International on Monday.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T00:47:47.871Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601275146\",\"tags\":\"$2f:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:props:widget:data:items:1:tags\",\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iran’s repeated use of 3,117 fuels doubts about official statistics\",\"id\":\"d61fa1ee-1f90-4936-94a6-a8cd061732ef\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/c4637f302413dfa287b2b2a8906305401402ec26-970x549.jpg?rect=0,2,970,546\u0026w=576\u0026h=324\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/c4637f302413dfa287b2b2a8906305401402ec26-970x549.jpg?rect=0,2,970,546\u0026w=768\u0026h=432\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/c4637f302413dfa287b2b2a8906305401402ec26-970x549.jpg?rect=0,2,970,546\u0026w=992\u0026h=558\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"Iran’s repeated use of 3,117 fuels doubts about official statistics\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"A single number – 3,117 – has appeared repeatedly in Iranian official statistics, from protest deaths to public health data, raising doubts about the credibility and methodology behind state-reported statistics.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T08:50:59.213Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601263163\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"'Where are you, son?' Iranian father's morgue odyssey breaks hearts\",\"id\":\"a035eaf9-12d1-4b21-9f16-d4f1503d3031\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/1daf300789d7deaa9489f7a3cdd04e2cf97b600c-665x1215.jpg?rect=23,0,621,778\u0026w=460\u0026h=576\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x5\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/1daf300789d7deaa9489f7a3cdd04e2cf97b600c-665x1215.jpg?rect=22,0,622,778\u0026w=614\u0026h=768\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x5\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/1daf300789d7deaa9489f7a3cdd04e2cf97b600c-665x1215.jpg?rect=22,0,622,778\u0026w=793\u0026h=992\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x5\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"alt\":\"'Where are you, son?' Iranian father's morgue odyssey breaks hearts\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"A long video of an Iranian father's agonized trudge among the bloodied corpses of slain protestors in a Tehran morgue in search of his son has seared viewers with the enormity of the state's mass killings this month.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T16:54:00.000Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601260391\",\"tags\":\"$2f:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:props:widget:data:items:3:tags\",\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Wealthy Iranian brothers chose protest and were killed\",\"id\":\"85cc4e21-90e7-4970-99a4-5a4d9eef4962\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/1dca55ba7d81281474fc9ec8c4494ddabc25853e-1050x1199.jpg?rect=5,0,958,1199\u0026w=460\u0026h=576\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x5\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/1dca55ba7d81281474fc9ec8c4494ddabc25853e-1050x1199.jpg?rect=5,0,959,1199\u0026w=614\u0026h=768\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x5\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/1dca55ba7d81281474fc9ec8c4494ddabc25853e-1050x1199.jpg?rect=5,0,958,1199\u0026w=793\u0026h=992\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4x5\",\"orientation\":\"portrait\"},\"alt\":\"Wealthy Iranian brothers chose protest and were killed\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Brothers Hamid and Vahid Arzanlou were two well-known entrepreneurs in Iran’s furniture industry who despite their wealth still chose to raise their voices in anti-government protests this month and paid with their lives.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-28T01:53:57.378Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601274875\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iranians burying slain protest youths mourn with dancing and defiance\",\"id\":\"a5b4ac0d-cb41-41f0-94aa-adcbd15867b2\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/7d6dd95581ef6fc83cf490ee221f1709a0c53f98-1396x783.png?rect=2,0,1392,783\u0026w=576\u0026h=324\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/7d6dd95581ef6fc83cf490ee221f1709a0c53f98-1396x783.png?rect=2,0,1392,783\u0026w=768\u0026h=432\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/7d6dd95581ef6fc83cf490ee221f1709a0c53f98-1396x783.png?rect=2,0,1392,783\u0026w=992\u0026h=558\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"Iranians burying slain protest youths mourn with dancing and defiance\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iranian families are turning funerals of youths killed in a deadly protest crackdown this month into celebrations of life, with dancing and wedding music aimed at defying their heartbreak and state repression.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T20:10:00.000Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601269005\",\"tags\":\"$2f:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:props:widget:data:items:5:tags\",\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iranian, Venezuelan dissidents call for US action to reclaim lost homelands\",\"id\":\"f9e0be12-4481-412b-919d-7198ae77a4e1\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/ca5bf07c4a7412409a8a405605e317e5f0a3b4d2-1920x1080.jpg?w=576\u0026h=324\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/ca5bf07c4a7412409a8a405605e317e5f0a3b4d2-1920x1080.jpg?w=768\u0026h=432\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/ca5bf07c4a7412409a8a405605e317e5f0a3b4d2-1920x1080.jpg?w=992\u0026h=558\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"Special conversation between Masih Alinejad and María Machado, leader of the Venezuelan opposition and Nobel Peace Prize winner\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iranian and Venezuelan opposition figures in a meeting in Washington DC urged the United States and its allies to act against what they described as an axis of repression between their two countries.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T22:30:00.000Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601274200\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"A protester’s final wish: 'Bury me wrapped in the lion and sun flag'\",\"id\":\"fc047179-c049-4aaa-bea7-2ca8be0360db\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/86f26fc913da726df05ef5cb821f0fcfb0047eca-716x444.png?rect=3,0,710,444\u0026w=576\u0026h=360\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x10\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/86f26fc913da726df05ef5cb821f0fcfb0047eca-716x444.png?rect=3,0,710,444\u0026w=768\u0026h=480\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x10\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/86f26fc913da726df05ef5cb821f0fcfb0047eca-716x444.png?rect=3,0,710,444\u0026w=992\u0026h=620\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x10\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"A protester’s final wish: 'Bury me wrapped in the lion and sun flag'\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Mojtaba (Shahmorad) Shahpari, a protester from the southwestern Iranian city of Izeh who was injured during the nationwide protests and later found dead in a cold storage warehouse in Isfahan, was laid to rest wrapped in the lion and sun flag, fulfilling his final wish.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-27T21:17:08.810Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601266691\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"article\"},{\"headline\":\"Iran judiciary says man convicted of spying for Israel’s Mossad was executed\",\"id\":\"37c326be-c6ee-4410-9427-20098c0d1434\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652.png?rect=1,0,978,652\u0026w=576\u0026h=384\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652.png?rect=1,0,978,652\u0026w=768\u0026h=512\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/cce26a941348570b12c4522082c4ac4567f04805-979x652.png?rect=1,0,978,652\u0026w=992\u0026h=661\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"3x2\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"Iran judiciary says man convicted of spying for Israel’s Mossad was executed\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"Iran’s judiciary said on Wednesday it executed a man it identified as Hamidreza Sabet Esmailipour, whom it accused of spying for Israel’s intelligence service, Mossad, after his death sentence was upheld by the Supreme Court.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-28T07:22:35.558Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601286083\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"story\"},{\"headline\":\"US deports three former IRGC members, ICE says\",\"id\":\"7f37fd34-7bcf-4dc3-b2cf-cce3a243e60a\",\"image\":{\"mobile\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/f6c553690bfa74af3dc88eecbc71f1071ad97707-686x384.jpg?rect=2,0,683,384\u0026w=576\u0026h=324\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"tablet\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/f6c553690bfa74af3dc88eecbc71f1071ad97707-686x384.jpg?rect=2,0,683,384\u0026w=768\u0026h=432\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"desktop\":{\"url\":\"https://i.iranintl.com/images/rdk9umy0/production/f6c553690bfa74af3dc88eecbc71f1071ad97707-686x384.jpg?rect=2,0,683,384\u0026w=992\u0026h=558\u0026q=80\u0026fit=max\u0026auto=format\",\"aspectRatio\":\"16x9\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"alt\":\"US deports three former IRGC members, ICE says\"},\"language\":\"english\",\"lead\":\"The United States has deported three former members of Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC), US Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) said in a post on X.\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-01-28T07:53:06.827Z\",\"shorthandUrl\":null,\"slug\":\"202601287563\",\"tags\":null,\"type\":\"story\"}]},\"language\":\"english\"}]}]}],\"$L39\",\"$L3a\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"39:[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"ArticleSidebar-module-scss-module__9-RIiG__item\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$8\",null,{\"fallback\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"WidgetSkeleton-module-scss-module__wn_WbG__widgetSkeleton\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Skeleton-module-scss-module__u3hcSa__skeletonImage \",\"style\":{\"aspectRatio\":\"3/2\",\"width\":\"100%\"},\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L38\",null,{\"widget\":{\"data\":{\"image\":{\"_type\":\"image\",\"asset\":{\"_ref\":\"image-e7802950c36d18d937b88453ade03b91460386ca-640x360-png\",\"_type\":\"reference\"}},\"u